  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/751/image_2024-03-04_102414885.png\" width=\"950\" height=\"336\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p><p><strong>末地珍馐是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>的一个附属模组，让你能够使用在末地发现的奇妙资源（如末影珍珠或紫颂果）烹饪美味佳肴。或者，将末影人或潜影贝的肉加入你的食谱，制作出真正非凡的餐点。有了这个模组，你可以突破Minecraft中烹饪的界限，探索全新的美食维度。准备好探索末地独特的风味，尝试新食谱，用你的烹饪技巧让朋友们惊叹吧！</strong></p><p>通过末地生物的新掉落物，为你喜爱的菜肴发现新食材！用末影视觉（不稳定的末影人眼睛，能发出刺眼的光芒）为你的菜肴增添一些闪光点。或者，用潜影贝软体动物（潜影贝坚硬外壳内的粘滑生物）增添独特口感。如果你想来点脆的，试试螨虫壳（脆但刺鼻的末影螨皮肤）。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/753/image_2024-03-04_102524576.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/623/436/2023-02-15_22.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/623/437/2023-02-15_22.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre>你可以将末地珍馐加入你的整合包！<br><br></pre><p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以看看我的其他模组：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollo